{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262kN3Y5gf5d1793570869.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>俄羅斯當局根據美國提供的情報，拘捕一名涉嫌策劃恐怖襲擊的未成年俄羅斯公民。</p><p></p><p>俄羅斯聯邦安全局星期日發通報表示，早一天從美方獲得可能發生恐襲的情報。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.RUS.ARREST-0400_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VLlBcKMydY1793570864.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>美國駐俄大使館當日發布安全警告，指位於莫斯科的察里津諾莊園博物館受到可能造成重大傷亡的威脅。通報指該名被捕的未成年人，曾在短片分享平台發布他身穿戰術服裝，手持疑似自動武器的相片，又發布他在察里津諾莊園博物館拍攝的照片，配上「我找到一個地方」的標題。</p><p></p><p>通報又指，被捕人有大量涉及恐怖襲擊、大規模殺戮和其他暴力行為的搜尋記錄。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:12.867026+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":235,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T21:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T05:58:49.568027+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:48.042069+00:00","content_hash":"9d0f608f39bdeff9f9b03a67a49ff6ddb33009905a0389a24e7a8130c41b177a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:12.867026+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}